{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "4db65acf-c365-4955-ab76-5f2627213cea",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3049",
            "content": {
                "en": "A notice from the staff of Jinlan Pavilion: Recent disappearances have occurred frequently on the road ahead leading to the stage.",
                "zh": "金兰观工作人员提醒您，前方通往戏台的路段近期人口失踪事件频发。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6839.2001953125,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "94046f4e-614e-4c16-9556-3314be268751",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3050",
            "content": {
                "en": "To maintain order during the festival and ensure everyone’s safety, all visitors and staff must follow the rules below.",
                "zh": "为保障大会期间的正常秩序与人员安全，请所有游客及工作人员遵守以下规则。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7157.60009765625,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "6f506cfb-0a27-4e93-81a2-bf3e6b2037ab",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3051",
            "content": {
                "en": "1. If you leave the street ahead and later find yourself entering the same street again, stay calm and observe your surroundings.",
                "zh": "1.若您在离开前方街道后，发现自己再次进入相同街道，请保持冷静注意观察。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7491.2001953125,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "12184823-469a-496f-b7a9-3c64e8b028ed",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3056",
            "content": {
                "en": "Follow the rules, and enjoy the festival. Everyone at Jinlan Pavilion wishes you a pleasant time at the Yuntai Festival.",
                "zh": "遵守规则，享受大会。金兰观全体人员，祝愿您在芸台大会期间游玩愉快。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 9098.400390625,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "cb2bc2ed-5c04-47a8-b252-9ab6cd0b6a60",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3057",
            "content": {
                "en": "The writing in the middle is very blurry. I can’t make it out.",
                "zh": "中间的字迹很模糊，看不清了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 9416.0,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "bcb44266-4696-4ffe-b139-c20bdfeeef51",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3052",
            "content": {
                "en": "2. According to survivor testimony, the street you pass through the first time is absolutely safe. Use it as your reference.",
                "zh": "2.经幸存者证言，您第一次通过的街道为绝对安全的，可以此为参照。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7827.2001953125,
            "positionY": 768.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "4e85fa4e-9979-4d03-80be-8414235edd8e",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3053",
            "content": {
                "en": "3. If you notice any abnormalities on the street, turn around immediately and leave to the left.",
                "zh": "3.如果您发现街道中存在有异常现象，请立刻转身，向左离开街道。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8145.60009765625,
            "positionY": 768.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "1103be2d-62e9-4cc3-b612-be67a975e43d",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3054",
            "content": {
                "en": "4. If everything seems normal, continue forward and head right toward the stage.",
                "zh": "4.如果街道中一切正常，请继续前进，向右前往戏台方向。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8478.400390625,
            "positionY": 768.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "3e3b36fd-f594-4165-a8a4-e1c846a22614",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3055",
            "content": {
                "en": "5. This street is only about a hundred meters long. If you find it stretching far into the distance, please…",
                "zh": "5.本条街道仅有约百米长，若您发现街道延申至极远方向，请......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8824.0,
            "positionY": 780.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
